[l_english.STATE_LORE_487]
In the northwest suburbs of Ponyville, the fourth princess of Equestria, Twilight Sparkle, once lived here. Relying on the power of friendship, she was rewarded with a beautiful castle, which has become an important landmark in Ponyville.
However, shortly after Canterlot fell, the three overlords who conquered Ponyville passed by and destroyed it. Now there is only a ruin left here: the Harmonist supporters did not rebuild or clean up here, partly because of fear of the empire, and partly because it is an accusation of the empire’s atrocities. At the same time, the empire did not rebuild or clean up here, because this is the best warning to the old Harmonists against the empire.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_487]
在小马谷的西北郊，小马利亚的第四位公主，暮光闪闪曾经在此居住。依靠友谊的力量，她被奖励了一个美丽的城堡，这里也成为了小马谷的一个重要地标。
不过在坎特洛特陷落后不久，征服小马谷的三巨头路过时就摧毁了这里，如今这里只剩下了一片废墟：那些谐律主义支持者们没有重建或者清理这里，一方面是因为对帝国的惧怕，另一方面这也是对帝国暴行的控诉。同时，帝国也没有重建或者清理这里，因为这是对反帝国的旧谐律分子最好的警告。
